					<description><![CDATA[The all-cellulose depth filtration range product is made of high-purity cellulose as the basic raw material and does not contain mineral auxiliary materials. High strength, reusable; strong chemical resistance, adapt to a variety of liquid environments. This series of products have a wide range of uses. They can be used for coarse filtration of high-viscosity liquids, pre-coated support filtration of filter aid fillers, and polishing, clarification, and fine filtration in various industries.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1> 1. ES-K Series For Viscous Liquid Filtration</h1>
<h2>  Introduction:</h2>
<p>ESK series paperboard is mainly used to filter liquids with high viscosity and high particle concentration. The paperboard is bulky, the internal cavity structure and the larger internal surface area, and the high dirt holding capacity of gelatinous impurities and particles, filter larger volume, can be used for polishing and filtering viscous liquids in chemical, cosmetics, food, industrial and other industries.</p>
<h2> Advantages and characteristics:</h2>
<ol>
<li>Strong dirt holding capacity and low replacement cost;</li>
<li>The fibers form an intricate cavity structure through interweaving, resulting in a huge internal surface area, which can be widely used under various usage conditions and purposes;</li>
<li>Effective adsorption characteristics can ensure safety;</li>
<li>The use of high-purity fiber raw materials has minimal impact on the filtrate;</li>
<li>Strict quality system management is implemented from feeding to leaving the factory to ensure stable and consistent product quality.</li>
</ol>
