<h1>3. Precoat &amp; support ES-P series</h1>
<h2>  Introduction:</h2>
<p>ES-P series cardboard is a pure fiber support filter cardboard that can be washed and reused and is widely used in pre-coated filtration in various industries. The surface texture of the P series cardboard is rough, which can provide support for various filter aid fillers (diatomite, perlite, activated carbon, polyvinyl alcohol polypyrrolidone pvpp, etc.) during the filtration process; high strength, users The filter cake layer can be easily removed at the end of each cycle. The P series supporting cardboard has a long service life and can be reused up to 30 times, reducing the cost of use.</p>
<h2>  Advantages and characteristics:</h2>
<ol>
<li>The pore size of the cardboard is evenly distributed, and the surface is rough so that the filter cake is evenly attached to the cardboard;</li>
<li>It is suitable for supporting filtration of a variety of professional filter aids;</li>
<li>With high wet strength, cardboard can be recycled to reduce costs;</li>
<li>The interior of the cardboard is tightly deconstructed, reducing the risk of particle leakage;</li>
<li>Very resistant to pressure transients circulating in filtration.</li>
</ol>
