<h1>4. High-precision pure fiber C series</h1>
<h2>   Introduction:</h2>
<p>The series paperboards do not add any mineral filter aids, have extremely high cellulose purity, can adapt to different chemical environments such as acid and alkali, greatly reduce the risk of metal ions precipitation, and can well retain the filtered liquid The color and fragrance. The special internal fiber structure of the C series can complete high-precision filtration tasks, realize the removal of microorganisms, and provide protection for subsequent membrane filtration. This new filter media can provide you with excellent filtration quality, maximize filtration capacity, and have extremely high chemical compatibility.</p>
<h2>   Advantages and characteristics:</h2>
<ol>
<li>Good chemical compatibility;</li>
<li>No mineral ingredients are added, and the content of metal ions is low;</li>
<li>Keep the fragrance and color of the original liquid to the greatest extent;</li>
<li>The ash content is less than 0.02%, which can achieve the greatest degree of ashing;</li>
<li>Biodegradable;</li>
<li>High filtration precision, which can satisfy clarification and partial sterilization filtration.</li>
</ol>
